# Line worker. Shift life, foreman gossip (R6), the night trucks.
%rec: OpeningBranch

cond: HasFlag('b_foreman_replaced')
goto: NewForeman

cond: true
goto: Default

%rec: Nodes

name: Default
npc: Ten minutes of break and you want to talk. Fine. Make it count.
#
o_text: What do they make here?
o_id: pell_make
o_goto: Make
#
o_text: Trucks at night, through the south gate. Seen them?
o_id: pell_trucks
o_goto: Trucks
#
o_text: (Offer him a smoke break.) Take a few more minutes, I'll keep watch.
o_id: pell_meld
o_cond: !HasFlag('pell_gift')
o_goto: Gift
#
o_text: Bye.
o_id: pell_bye
o_goto: Bye

name: Make
npc: Pod frames, filtration, cold units. Last month it was all cold units. Same kind they put in the ships. Nobody tells us what for, so we make jokes about it.
#
o_text: Back.
o_id: pell_make_back
o_goto: Default

name: Trucks
npc: Loaded cold units after shift. Caterers' vans followed them out once, I swear it. Ask the gate captain, he signs them through. Or don't, he's a bastard.
#
o_text: Back.
o_id: pell_trucks_back
o_goto: Default

name: Gift
npc: (He grins for the first time.) You're all right. Here, someone left this in the locker room. I don't use it.
effect: StackTransferFrom(NPC, 'meld', 1)
effect: SetFlag('pell_gift')
#
o_text: Thanks.
o_id: pell_gift_back
o_goto: Default

name: NewForeman
npc: Okafor's gone, the new one counts our breaks with a stopwatch. Whoever set that up, I hope they choke on it. (He looks at you a beat too long.)
effect: EndConversation

name: Bye
npc: Back to the line.
effect: EndConversation
